  "independent_findings": [
    "Custom QAccessibleValueInterface, interface_cast override, all shiboken pointer conversion and ValueChange event-filter code are removed.",
    "The class-restricted factory retains a normal QAccessibleWidget adapter on its existing widget; no manual Qt cache registration/deletion or ownership transfer is introduced.",
